  "lang": "en",
  "title": "MulmoTerminal 4.7.5 — a skill button that says what it will do",
  "description": "Short feature clip for MulmoTerminal 4.7.5. A Settings button that used to start an agent session the instant it was pressed now says what it will do, names the agent, and can be cancelled. Slides are English in both language versions — see 4.7.5-clips-NOTES.md.",
  "beats": [
    {
      "text": "Some settings hand the work to an agent. The line under the button says so, before you press it.",
