        "type": "html_tailwind",
        "animation": {
          "movie": true
        },
        "html": [
          "<div class='w-full h-full bg-slate-950 relative'>",
          "  <div class='absolute top-8 left-10 text-base tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-slate-600'>MulmoTerminal 4.7.5</div>",
          "  <div class='absolute left-0 right-0 text-center text-5xl font-semibold text-slate-100' style='top:84px'>It says so before you press.</div>",
          "  <div class='absolute' style='top:180px;left:110px;width:1060px'>",
          "    <video src='./skill-asks-first-assets/01-it-tells-you.mp4' autoplay muted playsinline class='rounded-xl shadow-2xl' style='width:1060px;display:block'></video>",
          "  </div>",
          "</div>"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Press it and it asks first. Which agent starts, that one terminal opens, and how to end it. Cancel, and you are exactly where you were.",
      "image": {
        "type": "html_tailwind",
        "animation": {
          "movie": true
        },
        "html": [
          "<div class='w-full h-full bg-slate-950 relative'>",
          "  <div class='absolute top-8 left-10 text-base tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-slate-600'>MulmoTerminal 4.7.5</div>",
          "  <div class='absolute left-0 right-0 text-center text-5xl font-semibold text-slate-100' style='top:84px'>It asks first.</div>",
          "  <div class='absolute' style='top:180px;left:110px;width:1060px'>",
          "    <video src='./skill-asks-first-assets/02-it-asks.mp4' autoplay muted playsinline class='rounded-xl shadow-2xl' style='width:1060px;display:block'></video>",
          "  </div>",
          "</div>"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Say yes, and that is exactly what happens. One new terminal, with the agent already in it.",
      "image": {
